  "term": "MHPG",
  "definition": "MHPG, or methoxyhydroxyphenylglycol, is a body-produced breakdown product of epinephrine and norepinephrine. It can be detected in the brain, blood, cerebrospinal fluid, and urine, and the amount present is used to reflect catecholamine turnover.",
